  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Police Reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the identified programme for a Sector Reform Contract (SRC) Support to reform of the Police in the Republic of Moldova is to ensure the rule of law, enhancement of public order and security and protection of human rights through the development of an accessible, accountable, efficient, representative, transparent and professional police force.</narrative>
  </description>
